scenario "eonax: a new project gets the connector sources" eonax_project_has_the_connector_sources
scenario "eonax: the Gaia-X mock stays in gaiax-mock/ and its switch points" eonax_gaiax_mock_stays_isolated
scenario "eonax: dev update reaches the course material" eonax_update_reaches_the_course_material
scenario "eonax: the map labels do not overlap" eonax_map_labels_do_not_overlap
scenario "eonax: polling loops allow a slow machine" eonax_waits_allow_a_slow_machine
scenario "eonax deploy: init generates strong, distinct secrets and keeps them" eonax_deploy_init_generates_secrets
scenario "eonax deploy: up refuses a default or empty secret, starts nothing" eonax_deploy_up_refuses_weak_secrets
